--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d7e76c79f1aa7df4391b0909e0ea0543, type: 3}
  m_Name: scholar
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AssassinMystery::AssassinMystery.SuspectData
  id: scholar
  displayName: Master Ilric Thorne
  role: Court Scholar
  profile: Studies old texts and stranger substances. His reagent cabinet holds things
    best kept locked.
  coatColor: {r: 0.29411766, g: 0.17254902, b: 0.41960785, a: 1}
  accentColor: {r: 0.7882353, g: 0.7058824, b: 0.34509805, a: 1}
  skinColor: {r: 0.8862745, g: 0.7764706, b: 0.68235296, a: 1}
  headwear: 6
  heightScale: 0.98
  beard: 1
  greeting: Ah, a visitor! Mind the scrolls, some are older than this castle.
  topics:
  - question: What do you study?
    response: Alchemy, herbs, the deeds of old kings. Mostly herbs, lately. Fascinating
      what a single leaf can do.
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 0}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
  - question: Where were you this afternoon?
    response: Here, the whole afternoon. Master Vale shared the long table with his
      ledgers... until just after the third bell, when he went out. He came back
      near the fourth, rather flushed.
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 0}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a7dc5d905aec18f4bbf63a7f55b8b216, type: 2}
  - question: Is anything missing from your cabinet?
    response: Missing? No... well, I have not looked today. Look if you like, the
      inventory is pinned inside the door.
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 0}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
  - question: Has anyone shown interest in the royal family lately?
    response: Duke Edric came yesterday to read the succession rolls. An odd thing,
      reading about your own sister's crown.
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 0}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
  - question: A vial of wolfsbane is missing from your cabinet.
    response: Gone? I... I went to fetch candles after the third bell, and the cabinet
      was unlocked. Anyone in the library could have taken it. I swear I gave it
      to no one!
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31c7e05a290471146aa26487bd1ab1a3, type: 2}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
